:R-HSA-72695  a             owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008150 ;
        rdfs:comment        "Binding of the methionyl-tRNA initiator to the active eIF2:GTP complex results in the formation of the ternary complex. Subsequently, this Met-tRNAi:eIF2:GTP (ternary) complex binds to the complex formed by the 40S subunit, eIF3 and eIF1A, to form the 43S complex." ;
        rdfs:label          "Formation of the ternary complex, and subsequently, the 43S complex" ;
        dc:contributor      "GOC:reactome_curators" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
        pav:providedBy      "https://reactome.org" ;
        oboInOwl:hasDbXref  "R-HSA-72695" ;
